Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 06:11:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Promotion records the entry's summaries kind

The extraction record is written in staging, and the ingest stages no
block summaries: they are the entry's own, drafted after it is filed. So
the record had no summaries kind, and a re-ingested entry lost the one
it had until the record was rebuilt in place (re-ingest pilot,
2026-11-15: both handbooks). After promotion the kind is now recorded
from the entry's summaries.json; with none, nothing is claimed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VQDpPfb62Puokdy7SvkiNR
